<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  {% include "head.njk" %}
</head>
<body>
<a href="#main" class="skip-link">Skip to main content</a>

{% include "icons.njk" %}
{% include "nav.njk" %}

  <main id="main">
    <section style="background:var(--bark);">
      <div class="section" style="text-align:center;">
        <p class="section-label" style="color:var(--clay);">Legal</p>
        <h1 class="section-title" style="color:var(--straw);">Privacy <em style="color:var(--clay);">Policy</em></h1>
        <p style="color:var(--straw); opacity:0.7; max-width:560px; margin:0 auto;">Last updated: {{ site.year }}</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section style="background:var(--cream);">
      <div class="section" style="max-width: 760px;">
        <div style="color:var(--bark); font-size:1rem; line-height:1.7;">
          <h2 style="color:var(--clay); font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif; margin:2rem 0 0.5rem;">Information We Collect</h2>
          <p>When you fill out our contact, estimate, or newsletter forms, we collect the information you provide — such as your name, phone number, email address, and project details. We use this information solely to respond to your inquiry, provide a quote, and communicate about services you've requested.</p>

          <h2 style="color:var(--clay); font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif; margin:2rem 0 0.5rem;">Forms &amp; Third-Party Processing</h2>
          <p>Our forms are processed securely through <a href="https://www.cloudflare.com/privacypolicy/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color:var(--clay);">Cloudflare</a>, which hosts this website and handles form submissions. We do not sell or rent your personal information to anyone.</p>

          <h2 style="color:var(--clay); font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif; margin:2rem 0 0.5rem;">Analytics</h2>
          <p>We use Google Analytics to understand how visitors use our site. Google Analytics collects non-identifying usage data, such as pages visited and approximate location, through cookies. You can opt out of Google Analytics by installing the <a href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color:var(--clay);">official opt-out browser add-on</a>.</p>

          <h2 style="color:var(--clay); font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif; margin:2rem 0 0.5rem;">Mailing List &amp; Unsubscribing</h2>
          <p>If you join our mailing list, we store your email address so we can send occasional seasonal tips and offers. Every email we send includes an unsubscribe link, and you can opt out at any time at <a href="/unsubscribe" style="color:var(--clay);">property-care.pages.dev/unsubscribe</a>. Unsubscribed addresses are removed from future mailings but retained only to honor your opt-out.</p>

          <h2 style="color:var(--clay); font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif; margin:2rem 0 0.5rem;">Your Rights</h2>
          <p>Depending on where you live, you may have the right to access, correct, or delete the personal information we hold about you. To exercise these rights, or to request removal from our mailing list, contact us using the details below.</p>

          <h2 style="color:var(--clay); font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif; margin:2rem 0 0.5rem;">Contact</h2>
          <p>Questions about this policy? Call us at <a href="tel:{{ site.phone }}" style="color:var(--clay); font-weight:600;">{{ site.phoneDisplay }}</a>.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

{% include "footer.njk" %}
